WEBVTT

01:31.640 --> 01:32.700
=The Road to Splendor=

01:32.700 --> 01:34.760
(Adapted from China Literature author
Zhizhi's novel of the same name)

01:35.460 --> 01:37.968
=Episode 31=

01:38.190 --> 01:40.110
Your Majesty,
please judge this matter fairly!

01:40.110 --> 01:41.750
Your Majesty,
please judge this matter fairly!

01:42.470 --> 01:44.270
(Northwest bribery, merchant murder)
Not even Wu's remains were left.

01:44.589 --> 01:47.030
(Destroying evidence, a heartless act)
When Wu refused their bribe demand,

01:47.030 --> 01:48.589
the Northwest officials killed her!

01:48.589 --> 01:50.309
Where is justice?

01:51.750 --> 01:54.069
Those people in the Northwest
have gone too far.

01:54.069 --> 01:54.949
The salt reform

01:54.949 --> 01:57.190
is clearly meant to benefit the people,

01:57.550 --> 01:59.869
yet they keep blocking it at every turn,

01:59.949 --> 02:01.509
afraid it will cost them
their own profits.

02:03.030 --> 02:05.429
Where is justice?

02:06.470 --> 02:07.110
How dare you!

02:07.949 --> 02:09.189
Gathering a crowd to cause trouble

02:09.189 --> 02:10.429
and disturbing His Majesty?

02:10.709 --> 02:11.309
Do you realize

02:11.589 --> 02:12.749
what you're risking?

02:12.749 --> 02:14.909
(Northwest bribery, merchant murder)
Your Majesty, please investigate it!

02:14.909 --> 02:16.629
(Northwest bribery, merchant murder)
Give the Wu family justice!

02:16.629 --> 02:18.909
We beg Your Majesty
to investigate the Northwest!

02:18.909 --> 02:20.990
Give the Wu family justice!

02:20.990 --> 02:23.550
We beg Your Majesty
to investigate the Northwest!

02:23.550 --> 02:25.670
Give the Wu family justice!

02:26.070 --> 02:26.990
Your Majesty, please see the truth.

02:27.510 --> 02:28.469
This protest by the Anzhou merchants

02:29.110 --> 02:30.510
must have been orchestrated by someone
behind the scenes.

02:30.830 --> 02:31.790
I request permission

02:32.230 --> 02:32.749
to immediately...

02:37.510 --> 02:39.309
Merchants are kneeling outside,

02:39.790 --> 02:41.429
and the people are in an uproar.

02:42.270 --> 02:43.270
This matter

02:44.070 --> 02:45.670
must come to a resolution.

02:48.790 --> 02:50.429
General Mo is incorruptible.

02:51.029 --> 02:52.189
He would never embezzle funds,

02:52.629 --> 02:54.189
much less extort merchants for bribes.

02:57.230 --> 02:58.990
Please reconsider, Your Majesty.

02:59.550 --> 03:01.029
How could I not know

03:01.189 --> 03:03.070
that the Northwest guards
the state's vital frontier,

03:03.230 --> 03:04.909
keeping Wangur from daring
to invade again?

03:05.230 --> 03:06.270
I remember

03:06.350 --> 03:07.790
all they have done.

03:09.110 --> 03:10.629
But sometimes,

03:11.429 --> 03:12.670
emotions and reason

03:13.830 --> 03:15.230
cannot both be served.

03:17.429 --> 03:18.189
Before,

03:18.390 --> 03:19.709
the Grand Empress Dowager
stepped forward

03:19.830 --> 03:21.429
to resolve the imperial mausoleum
matter.

03:22.909 --> 03:23.790
But later,

03:23.790 --> 03:25.790
I still issued
an edict of self-criticism.

03:26.869 --> 03:27.909
Do you think

03:28.429 --> 03:29.589
that edict

03:29.909 --> 03:31.869
was meant for the people to see,

03:32.309 --> 03:33.350
or was it meant

03:33.469 --> 03:34.790
for my grandmother?

03:42.230 --> 03:44.510
In that edict, I condemned myself,

03:44.869 --> 03:45.950
but in truth,

03:45.950 --> 03:47.429
I was condemning my grandmother.

03:47.990 --> 03:49.909
I hoped she would take it as a warning

03:49.990 --> 03:51.830
and stop acting beyond proper bounds.

03:52.709 --> 03:54.230
The Grand Empress Dowager said

03:55.830 --> 03:57.589
she would not bring up the matter
of joint burial for now.

03:57.869 --> 03:59.830
I don't want her
to merely let it go this time.

04:00.589 --> 04:02.469
I want her to never mention it

04:02.830 --> 04:03.990
again.

04:05.189 --> 04:06.510
I told you before,

04:07.029 --> 04:08.909
I truly respect my grandmother.

04:09.990 --> 04:12.110
Yet I must deceive her,

04:12.309 --> 04:13.230
and even

04:13.589 --> 04:15.510
leave her condemned
in the history books.

04:16.069 --> 04:17.230
Do you think

04:17.629 --> 04:19.030
it doesn't pain me?

04:19.749 --> 04:21.509
But sitting on this throne,

04:22.389 --> 04:23.710
I must weigh

04:24.670 --> 04:26.869
even my own feelings
against the greater good.

04:28.030 --> 04:29.470
As a matter of fact,

04:29.869 --> 04:31.869
I've known Mo Yi

04:32.429 --> 04:34.309
even longer than you have.

04:35.509 --> 04:37.110
Do you remember?

04:43.230 --> 04:43.949
Huchen,

04:44.629 --> 04:45.949
I believe

04:46.230 --> 04:47.509
we've talked enough.

04:48.710 --> 04:50.110
But I want to ask you one thing.

04:50.869 --> 04:51.710
Are you

04:52.230 --> 04:53.309
my man,

04:54.110 --> 04:55.829
or the Northwest's?

05:05.550 --> 05:07.110
If Mo Yi's case isn't resolved,

05:07.509 --> 05:09.269
the Northwest's reputation
will be ruined.

05:09.790 --> 05:10.949
The salt reform cannot move forward,

05:11.069 --> 05:12.710
and the court's deadlock will remain.

05:13.509 --> 05:14.829
You know which matters more.

05:20.790 --> 05:21.790
Your work

05:22.470 --> 05:23.869
has always earned my trust.

05:24.790 --> 05:25.629
This time,

05:26.429 --> 05:27.949
don't disappoint me.

05:31.710 --> 05:32.509
Your Majesty,

05:40.910 --> 05:42.509
I will not fail you.

05:45.629 --> 05:46.949
Concubine Wu

05:47.110 --> 05:49.030
has always been unpredictable.

05:50.030 --> 05:52.110
She should have delivered it by now.

05:53.949 --> 05:54.869
Could it be

05:56.110 --> 05:57.470
she's changed her mind?

05:58.869 --> 05:59.710
Wait a little longer.

06:01.408 --> 06:03.584
(Graceful and Virtuous)

06:06.269 --> 06:06.949
Madam.

06:09.749 --> 06:11.110
Jingxiu

06:11.110 --> 06:12.269
has been troubled lately.

06:12.470 --> 06:13.910
Go keep him company for a while.

06:15.710 --> 06:17.470
This is aged Lihua Bai wine.

06:17.749 --> 06:18.829
It's perfect

06:19.470 --> 06:20.790
for helping him open his heart.

06:28.030 --> 06:29.110
Thank you, Madam.

06:29.110 --> 06:30.629
The Yu family has few heirs.

06:30.910 --> 06:33.389
Young Madam is no longer an option.

06:33.749 --> 06:34.509
You've been

06:35.309 --> 06:37.110
in this household for quite some time.

06:37.590 --> 06:38.990
No matter whom a woman relies on,

06:39.629 --> 06:41.550
no one is more dependable
than her own child.

06:43.990 --> 06:45.069
I understand.

06:45.629 --> 06:46.749
Good.

06:46.749 --> 06:47.910
Go on, then.

06:48.030 --> 06:49.230
An opportunity like this is rare.

06:49.389 --> 06:50.910
I'm only thinking of what's best
for you.

06:51.590 --> 06:52.309
Yes,

06:52.309 --> 06:52.949
Madam.

07:00.350 --> 07:01.710
I chose the Yu family

07:02.189 --> 07:03.470
not for wealth or status.

07:03.829 --> 07:05.389
I thought a family of scholars

07:05.590 --> 07:07.230
would not be home to such wicked people.

07:07.790 --> 07:08.670
But now,

07:09.069 --> 07:10.829
my aunt died because of the Yu family.

07:12.429 --> 07:13.790
I was wrong about them once.

07:14.230 --> 07:16.030
I won't make the same mistake again.

07:16.949 --> 07:18.110
I need to find a way

07:18.590 --> 07:19.790
to get my aunt's journal

07:19.790 --> 07:20.550
out of here.

07:20.550 --> 07:21.949
My Lady, please reconsider.

07:22.869 --> 07:23.829
Right now,

07:23.829 --> 07:24.949
the household is watching closely.

07:25.629 --> 07:26.509
There are even

07:26.990 --> 07:28.470
servants guarding the door.

07:28.869 --> 07:29.910
It will be difficult

07:29.910 --> 07:31.269
to send anything out again.

07:36.224 --> 07:38.580
(Qingli Hall of Learning)

07:52.869 --> 07:53.670
Young Master.

07:55.670 --> 07:56.470
What?

07:57.309 --> 07:59.110
Mother couldn't get Young Madam
to do it,

07:59.710 --> 08:00.910
so now she's sending you instead?

08:01.710 --> 08:03.470
Whatever happens between Madam
and Young Madam

08:03.829 --> 08:05.429
has nothing to do with me.

08:13.189 --> 08:14.670
I only thought

08:15.110 --> 08:16.509
you were troubled at the moment.

08:16.990 --> 08:18.269
You may need someone to comfort you.

08:22.230 --> 08:23.990
You are both people who have fallen
on hard times.

08:24.829 --> 08:26.030
Ninth Young Lady

08:27.069 --> 08:28.949
is having a difficult time herself.

08:35.310 --> 08:37.190
She has lost her mother and then
her father in quick succession.

08:38.230 --> 08:39.590
Her heart is already heavy with grief.

08:40.629 --> 08:42.070
And yet, at a time like this,

08:43.830 --> 08:45.869
my father still used the past
to humiliate her.

08:56.190 --> 08:58.110
I went to Tanshui Temple today

08:58.789 --> 09:00.310
to pray for my aunt.

09:01.830 --> 09:03.029
I also thought

09:04.629 --> 09:06.669
of lighting a prayer lamp
for the Ninth Young Lady.

09:12.629 --> 09:13.430
Young Master.

09:14.230 --> 09:16.669
If the scripture is touched
by the worldly presence of others,

09:17.029 --> 09:18.350
it may lose its blessing.

09:26.710 --> 09:27.830
I know

09:28.389 --> 09:29.909
you still care about her.

09:30.310 --> 09:31.070
Why not

09:31.470 --> 09:32.830
send someone to take this

09:33.029 --> 09:34.190
to Xie Jewelry Shop?

09:34.629 --> 09:35.950
Consider it a way to repay

09:35.950 --> 09:37.230
the kindness she showed me.

09:50.549 --> 09:51.269
Chengxin.

09:53.669 --> 09:54.350
Young Master.

09:54.629 --> 09:55.470
Take this there.

09:56.470 --> 09:57.230
Remember,

09:58.470 --> 10:00.430
do not let anyone else touch it.

10:01.830 --> 10:02.990
It may ruin the blessing.

10:04.310 --> 10:04.830
Yes.

10:10.860 --> 10:12.896
(The Diamond Sutra)

10:13.749 --> 10:14.509
Just as I thought.

10:15.230 --> 10:16.029
Madam Wu

10:16.190 --> 10:17.629
was bribing officials to push
the salt reforms forward.

10:18.230 --> 10:19.470
And the Mo family wasn't the only one.

10:20.190 --> 10:21.070
This records

10:21.070 --> 10:22.629
the preferences of influential families.

10:22.830 --> 10:23.749
Excellent.

10:23.909 --> 10:25.070
With this,

10:25.070 --> 10:27.230
we can prove Madam Wu
donated the money voluntarily.

10:27.230 --> 10:28.629
There's hope for the Northwest.

10:29.950 --> 10:30.749
There's hope.

10:31.830 --> 10:32.749
There's hope.

10:35.310 --> 10:35.909
Madam.

10:36.470 --> 10:37.629
Madam, someone is here.

10:37.710 --> 10:38.430
No.

10:38.430 --> 10:39.310
I won't see anyone.

10:39.310 --> 10:40.470
It's Commander Zhao.

10:53.029 --> 10:54.029
Madam Mo.

10:54.669 --> 10:55.710
Commander Zhao.

11:00.669 --> 11:02.470
His Majesty has ordered me
to handle this matter.

11:03.629 --> 11:04.789
Do you have any message

11:07.669 --> 11:08.869
for General Mo?

11:10.950 --> 11:12.509
If you're the one questioning Mo Yi,

11:13.669 --> 11:15.070
then I can rest assured.

11:15.749 --> 11:16.350
By the way,

11:16.509 --> 11:18.190
I happen to have something to send him.

11:18.269 --> 11:18.869
Commander Zhao,

11:18.869 --> 11:19.669
please have a seat.

11:28.549 --> 11:29.230
It's fine.

11:29.749 --> 11:30.470
It's fine.

11:31.470 --> 11:32.190
Take it.

11:39.470 --> 11:40.470
Mo Yi may be

11:40.590 --> 11:41.669
a tough man,

11:42.869 --> 11:44.470
but he's never had to endure

11:44.470 --> 11:45.509
the hardships of prison.

11:45.990 --> 11:46.909
The weather is turning cold.

11:47.350 --> 11:48.070
It's cold in the cell.

11:48.869 --> 11:50.070
My children and I

11:51.190 --> 11:52.590
spent three days and nights

11:53.029 --> 11:54.029
making this for him.

11:54.629 --> 11:56.029
Please make sure he gets it.

12:03.909 --> 12:04.830
Is there anything

12:08.269 --> 12:09.629
you'd like me to tell General Mo?

12:14.350 --> 12:15.470
We've been married for years.

12:15.869 --> 12:17.269
There's no need for sweet words.

12:19.470 --> 12:20.430
Whatever needs to be said,

12:22.509 --> 12:24.110
I'll tell him when he comes home.

13:16.430 --> 13:17.070
Mo Yi.

13:17.190 --> 13:17.789
Time for questioning.

13:36.470 --> 13:37.430
Ling.

13:38.110 --> 13:39.950
I'm relieved it's you.

13:53.070 --> 13:54.830
Quite a feast.

13:55.669 --> 13:56.669
How long has it been

13:58.389 --> 14:00.310
since we had a drink together?

14:01.549 --> 14:02.070
Here.

14:02.830 --> 14:03.590
Tonight,

14:04.669 --> 14:06.350
let's share a few good cups.

14:07.470 --> 14:08.230
Fill them up.

14:16.789 --> 14:17.590
Smells wonderful.

14:25.110 --> 14:26.389
Technically,

14:26.830 --> 14:28.310
I'm a few years older than you,

14:29.269 --> 14:30.310
and I also

14:30.789 --> 14:32.389
entered court service
a few years before you did.

14:32.830 --> 14:34.549
You should call me Brother.

14:36.310 --> 14:37.430
But

14:37.549 --> 14:38.990
to be fair,

14:41.110 --> 14:43.549
you surpass me in every way.

14:45.350 --> 14:46.869
The achievements in Yongning Prefecture,

14:48.029 --> 14:49.590
the honor of the Northwest Army,

14:50.389 --> 14:52.110
all of it is thanks to you.

14:54.350 --> 14:54.789
Come on.

14:55.830 --> 14:56.710
This toast

14:58.269 --> 14:58.990
is to you.

14:59.669 --> 15:00.549
Consider it

15:01.269 --> 15:02.230
my thanks.

15:03.749 --> 15:04.909
General Mo, your bravery

15:07.470 --> 15:09.190
rid me of Feng Laosi,

15:11.430 --> 15:13.070
and gave me a chance to survive.

15:16.070 --> 15:17.990
You also guided me in Ganlin Town.

15:22.869 --> 15:24.070
I should be the one to toast you.

15:26.230 --> 15:27.710
Didn't I tell you to call me Brother?

15:29.230 --> 15:31.230
Why are you still calling me General Mo?

15:32.950 --> 15:34.389
Don't you see me as your brother
anymore?

15:40.110 --> 15:41.310
Brother Mo.

15:46.830 --> 15:47.350
Cheers.

15:54.110 --> 15:54.990
Ling.

15:56.190 --> 15:57.029
I know

15:58.070 --> 15:59.070
the Northwest

16:00.830 --> 16:02.310
can't afford to be dragged into this.

16:03.710 --> 16:05.029
It's my own fault.

16:05.749 --> 16:06.749
I insisted on

16:08.350 --> 16:10.509
chasing the same fame
and power as others.

16:11.269 --> 16:12.230
And in the end,

16:13.590 --> 16:14.830
all I got in return

16:19.789 --> 16:22.230
was a blade turned against me.

16:23.590 --> 16:25.350
You've suffered enough
because of me, Ling.

16:26.789 --> 16:28.350
And now you have to clean up my mess.

16:34.749 --> 16:35.789
Does my wife

16:37.230 --> 16:38.909
have anything to say to me?

16:45.029 --> 16:46.350
She said...

16:51.710 --> 16:53.749
She hoped to be your wife again
in another life.

17:01.190 --> 17:02.389
Ling,

17:02.470 --> 17:03.110
you...

17:03.389 --> 17:05.269
You really don't know her well enough.

17:05.789 --> 17:06.910
Let me tell you something.

17:07.470 --> 17:09.470
Even if you had me executed right now,

17:09.910 --> 17:11.630
she'd shed a few tears,

17:11.630 --> 17:13.870
and never want to see me again
in the next life.

17:17.470 --> 17:18.589
Still, Ling,

17:19.430 --> 17:21.309
I appreciate your kindness.

17:22.710 --> 17:23.190
Come on.

17:26.950 --> 17:27.549
Bottoms up.

17:45.910 --> 17:46.910
All right.

17:48.390 --> 17:50.069
It's almost time.

17:52.470 --> 17:53.549
Time to do this.

17:56.910 --> 17:58.109
But Ling,

17:59.269 --> 18:00.470
this time,

18:01.749 --> 18:03.950
you'll have to be the one to do it.

18:04.910 --> 18:06.109
These are turbulent times.

18:07.069 --> 18:08.029
Don't give His Majesty

18:08.029 --> 18:09.870
any reason to doubt you.

18:27.349 --> 18:27.870
Come on.

18:54.789 --> 18:55.710
Ling...

18:57.390 --> 18:58.309
From now on,

18:59.309 --> 19:02.029
I'll have to leave my wife and children
in your care.

19:02.630 --> 19:03.549
Consider it

19:04.309 --> 19:06.349
the fulfillment of the bond
we shared as brothers in arms.

19:06.749 --> 19:07.509
Will you do that for me?

19:10.289 --> 19:11.410
Don't worry.

19:53.984 --> 19:59.340
♪The wind sweeps the yellow sands,
as a grand ballad rings out♪

19:59.872 --> 20:04.400
♪A lone rider heads
for the distant frontier♪

20:06.060 --> 20:11.232
♪The road stretches on,
swallowed by wind and sand♪

20:11.792 --> 20:17.040
♪My unyielding spirit shines
across the land♪

20:18.080 --> 20:23.520
♪The wind howls,
yet never chills my soul♪

20:24.128 --> 20:29.840
♪War drums resound across the vast sky♪

20:30.420 --> 20:35.744
♪I laugh to the heavens to hide my sobs♪

20:36.256 --> 20:41.840
♪Looking back, this life was a song♪

20:45.488 --> 20:52.480
♪Looking back,
I see this life as a song♪

21:13.069 --> 21:14.470
You're back so late.

21:15.109 --> 21:16.309
Have you had dinner?

21:22.630 --> 21:24.190
Regarding Madam Wu's case,

21:24.910 --> 21:26.470
I found a piece of evidence.

21:26.549 --> 21:27.589
It may prove useful.

21:28.309 --> 21:29.470
I'll show it to you.

21:30.309 --> 21:30.950
Don't go.

21:41.710 --> 21:42.950
Stay with me for a while.

22:23.349 --> 22:24.509
Madam Wu's case

22:27.390 --> 22:28.589
will be resolved soon.

22:29.390 --> 22:30.950
The Northwest will be fine.

22:32.910 --> 22:33.630
Really?

22:35.749 --> 22:37.029
A few days ago,

22:38.430 --> 22:40.349
weren't the Anzhou merchants
still causing a scene?

22:42.309 --> 22:43.710
How did they

22:43.710 --> 22:45.190
give up so quickly?

22:46.710 --> 22:47.630
His Majesty

22:50.430 --> 22:51.630
upheld justice.

22:54.190 --> 22:56.829
And with the Grand Empress Dowager
granting Madam Wu a lavish burial,

22:58.190 --> 22:59.789
the matter has come to an end.

23:06.710 --> 23:07.990
There must be a lot going on

23:08.349 --> 23:09.749
in the capital lately.

23:11.910 --> 23:13.029
Try not to go out too much for now.

23:15.630 --> 23:16.670
Just rest up and take care of yourself.

23:40.336 --> 23:42.592
(Mo Residence)

23:54.589 --> 23:55.349
Madam.

24:04.349 --> 24:05.710
When did this happen?

24:06.029 --> 24:07.670
The authorities informed
us this morning.

24:07.670 --> 24:08.710
They asked us to bring him home.

24:24.220 --> 24:26.220
(Coffin of My Late Husband,
General Mo Yi)

24:40.269 --> 24:42.109
I even knelt before you.

24:43.870 --> 24:45.390
I trusted you with all my heart.

24:48.349 --> 24:49.309
How could Zhao Ling

24:50.910 --> 24:53.549
do something so cruel?

24:56.309 --> 24:57.910
After all these years of friendship...

25:00.670 --> 25:02.950
How could he bear to do this?

25:06.789 --> 25:08.390
Why didn't you tell me?

25:11.470 --> 25:14.670
I thought of you as my own sister.

25:17.349 --> 25:17.990
Come here.

25:18.470 --> 25:19.230
Look!

25:19.470 --> 25:21.470
You're the sworn mother

25:21.950 --> 25:24.190
of my three children!

25:24.589 --> 25:26.390
Why didn't you tell me?

25:27.509 --> 25:31.349
Why didn't you tell me?

25:32.390 --> 25:34.309
These are matters

25:34.309 --> 25:35.470
beyond what women like us can decide.

25:35.630 --> 25:37.190
Why blame her for this?

25:37.269 --> 25:38.190
Don't blame her?

25:41.910 --> 25:42.829
Then who should I blame?

25:45.549 --> 25:47.430
You!

25:48.870 --> 25:50.990
Mo!

25:51.430 --> 25:53.069
Get up!

25:53.549 --> 25:55.549
You heartless man!

26:02.670 --> 26:04.309
Only three months after we married,

26:04.430 --> 26:06.870
you rode off to war to the sound
of the war horns.

26:07.670 --> 26:08.950
You were never home.

26:10.950 --> 26:12.589
When you finally returned,

26:13.789 --> 26:15.390
you even brought back a mistress.

26:16.430 --> 26:19.029
I bore you three children.

26:19.710 --> 26:20.910
How could you just

26:20.910 --> 26:22.309
leave the three of us

26:22.829 --> 26:24.230
behind?

26:24.230 --> 26:26.470
Get up!

26:30.069 --> 26:33.509
You get up!

26:33.509 --> 26:34.440
(Coffin of My Late Husband,
General Mo Yi)

26:38.829 --> 26:39.509
- Sister!
- Sister!

26:39.509 --> 26:39.990
Sister!

26:40.309 --> 26:40.950
Sister!

26:42.029 --> 26:43.470
Your health comes first.

26:45.950 --> 26:46.670
Sister!

26:52.910 --> 26:53.870
At the end of the day,

26:54.390 --> 26:55.109
it's my fault.

26:57.190 --> 26:59.349
I shouldn't have pushed him
to chase success and glory.

27:01.069 --> 27:02.190
It's my fault.

27:04.190 --> 27:05.950
I shouldn't have kept finding fault
with him.

27:07.589 --> 27:10.509
I shouldn't have urged him
to get involved in those donations.

27:10.589 --> 27:11.789
That's what led us

27:12.230 --> 27:15.190
to where we are today!

27:15.670 --> 27:17.109
It's my fault!

27:17.109 --> 27:18.029
Mother!

27:18.029 --> 27:18.710
It's all my fault!

27:18.710 --> 27:19.470
Sister!

27:19.470 --> 27:20.029
Sister!

27:20.549 --> 27:21.309
Sister!

27:23.109 --> 27:23.670
Sister!

27:23.670 --> 27:25.470
It's all my fault!

27:25.470 --> 27:27.109
Take care of yourself!

27:27.109 --> 27:28.589
Mother!

27:33.900 --> 27:36.000
(Mo Residence)

27:49.950 --> 27:50.950
I told you

27:51.870 --> 27:53.789
I had found the key piece of evidence.

27:54.109 --> 27:56.190
All we had to do was submit it
to Chengqian Prefecture for a retrial.

27:56.190 --> 27:57.990
Why couldn't you wait
even a few more days?

28:17.630 --> 28:19.749
Even if you obtained
the bribery records,

28:21.829 --> 28:22.829
what would they prove?

28:24.390 --> 28:25.430
This matter

28:26.710 --> 28:28.589
was ordered by His Majesty himself.

28:28.589 --> 28:30.430
He chose to sacrifice Mo Yi
to calm the Anzhou merchants.

28:31.109 --> 28:32.269
Whatever the truth is,

28:34.230 --> 28:35.430
does His Majesty even care?

28:37.309 --> 28:39.630
He only wants to stabilize
the situation around the salt reform

28:39.630 --> 28:41.109
and fill the treasury
as soon as possible.

28:45.470 --> 28:47.349
There's nothing we can do to save him.

28:49.710 --> 28:50.870
It's already decided.

28:55.470 --> 28:57.710
Now we must pull ourselves together

29:02.470 --> 29:04.190
and prepare for the next move.

29:08.509 --> 29:09.630
The next move?

29:11.950 --> 29:13.509
What could possibly come next?

29:18.749 --> 29:20.190
I'm afraid His Majesty

29:22.309 --> 29:23.990
will use this to promote me,

29:24.549 --> 29:25.789
and grant you an official title.

29:30.710 --> 29:32.309
Then we'd have to hold
a promotion banquet.

29:48.789 --> 29:50.910
I can play the role of Madam Zhao well.

29:52.029 --> 29:53.549
But I'm afraid that one day...

29:56.190 --> 29:57.390
while playing this role,

29:59.390 --> 30:00.910
I might become Madam Yu.

30:03.069 --> 30:04.789
And you might become Grand Secretary Yu.

30:08.430 --> 30:09.749
I regret it more and more...

30:11.029 --> 30:11.829
that back then,

30:13.950 --> 30:15.710
for my own selfish desires,

30:16.430 --> 30:17.990
I pushed you onto the path of politics.

30:39.349 --> 30:40.029
Former

30:40.710 --> 30:42.789
Northwestern Guerrilla General Mo Yi

30:44.430 --> 30:46.109
attempted to extort a bribe
from the merchant

30:47.029 --> 30:48.269
and killed her in rage when he failed.

30:49.509 --> 30:51.390
Having betrayed the Emperor's grace,

30:52.269 --> 30:53.549
he was confined
in the Imperial Prison...

31:01.470 --> 31:02.390
and was executed.

31:04.349 --> 31:05.230
Mo Yi,

31:05.829 --> 31:07.549
though his crimes warrant death
by a thousand cuts,

31:08.230 --> 31:09.549
in recognition of his past loyalty
and bravery

31:09.670 --> 31:11.549
and his achievements in battle,

31:11.990 --> 31:12.670
it is hereby ordered

31:13.029 --> 31:14.630
that his wife and daughters
be spared exile

31:14.870 --> 31:16.470
and allowed to live as commoners.

31:18.309 --> 31:19.549
Your Majesty is wise and just.

31:19.749 --> 31:21.630
This case was resolved swiftly,

31:22.230 --> 31:23.910
preventing unrest throughout the court
and the realm.

31:24.190 --> 31:25.549
I am greatly pleased.

31:25.990 --> 31:26.990
I hereby grant Zhao Ling

31:26.990 --> 31:29.309
the honorary rank
of Third-Rank General Zhaoyong

31:29.309 --> 31:30.309
and bestow an official decree upon him.

31:30.430 --> 31:32.509
His wife, Fu, has rendered
meritorious assistance.

31:32.829 --> 31:33.470
Therefore,

31:33.589 --> 31:34.630
you are hereby promoted to

31:34.630 --> 31:35.910
Second-Rank Lady.

31:36.190 --> 31:36.870
You are hereby granted:

31:36.870 --> 31:40.390
a gold-embroidered ceremonial cape
with cloud and peacock patterns,

31:40.390 --> 31:41.670
a jeweled pheasant crown,

31:41.670 --> 31:42.990
an annual stipend of one hundred dan,

31:43.069 --> 31:44.309
and permission to attend court

31:44.390 --> 31:45.109
on New Year's Day

31:45.109 --> 31:48.309
and the Winter Solstice
in official attire.

31:48.549 --> 31:50.190
Accept this imperial favor.

31:50.190 --> 31:51.670
So decreed.

31:51.990 --> 31:52.910
I

31:52.990 --> 31:54.349
thank His Majesty
for his gracious favor.

32:12.240 --> 32:14.400
(Imperial Decree)

32:16.230 --> 32:16.910
I humbly thank

32:17.509 --> 32:18.910
Your Majesty for this gracious favor.

32:42.069 --> 32:43.430
He fought against Grand Secretary Yu

32:43.670 --> 32:44.470
and lost.

32:44.470 --> 32:45.670
Yet his rank was raised.

32:45.990 --> 32:48.509
A promotion in honorary rank
from fourth rank to senior third rank.

32:48.509 --> 32:49.710
And all in such a short time.

32:50.309 --> 32:51.470
Not to mention

32:51.470 --> 32:52.430
that bracelet.

32:52.589 --> 32:54.230
It was worn by His Majesty himself.

32:54.829 --> 32:56.829
He is the only one in the entire court
who possesses one.

32:56.990 --> 32:59.870
His third-rank wife
was elevated to the second rank.

33:01.430 --> 33:02.349
Such a thing

33:02.789 --> 33:05.990
has never happened since the founding
of the dynasty.

33:06.430 --> 33:07.950
His Majesty is making it clear

33:07.950 --> 33:09.589
to all officials in the court

33:09.589 --> 33:11.589
that Zhao Ling

33:11.589 --> 33:12.670
is his trusted aide,

33:13.509 --> 33:14.990
not the Northwest's man.

33:17.029 --> 33:19.870
Right now, you can't tell
whether he won or lost,

33:20.509 --> 33:21.069
because

33:21.069 --> 33:23.230
the decisive moment has yet to come.

33:23.749 --> 33:24.990
The Emperor's biggest concern

33:24.990 --> 33:25.910
is the imperial treasury.

33:26.069 --> 33:28.069
Whoever can solve this problem

33:28.309 --> 33:29.549
will become

33:29.549 --> 33:30.749
His Majesty's favorite.

33:32.549 --> 33:33.950
Congratulations, General Zhao.

33:35.710 --> 33:38.029
Does that lapis lazuli bracelet

33:39.269 --> 33:40.069
feel smooth

33:40.069 --> 33:41.190
in your hand?

33:46.630 --> 33:48.029
Grand Secretary Yu, you flatter me.

33:49.630 --> 33:51.349
I am merely blessed
by His Majesty's gracious favor.

33:55.269 --> 33:57.430
General Zhao, you are still so young,

33:57.430 --> 33:59.069
yet you already hold such great power.

34:01.349 --> 34:02.589
But do you know

34:03.349 --> 34:05.430
what power truly is?

34:06.509 --> 34:08.229
From now on,

34:10.029 --> 34:12.390
you must do the things you want to do,

34:13.310 --> 34:15.029
and the things you don't want to do

34:15.029 --> 34:16.390
you must do as well.

34:17.109 --> 34:19.509
Those you wish to kill, you must kill.

34:20.589 --> 34:23.430
Those you don't wish to kill,
you must kill too.

34:28.189 --> 34:30.669
Do you feel that bracelet in your hand

34:32.350 --> 34:33.910
growing heavier

34:34.390 --> 34:36.229
and harder to bear?

35:06.830 --> 35:08.270
You were born into the Yu family,

35:08.270 --> 35:09.470
raised in the Yu family,

35:09.470 --> 35:12.709
and witnessed its enduring prosperity.

35:13.029 --> 35:14.470
You have seen enough of the world.

35:15.870 --> 35:16.830
In your opinion,

35:17.470 --> 35:18.470
what kind of man

35:18.470 --> 35:19.830
is Zhao Ling?

35:21.029 --> 35:22.270
I think

35:22.950 --> 35:24.310
he is no different

35:24.470 --> 35:25.470
from Madam Wu.

35:28.830 --> 35:29.830
Like a blade of grass.

35:30.310 --> 35:31.270
Because he has no roots,

35:31.430 --> 35:33.310
he has to fight his way upward.

35:33.470 --> 35:34.629
He must also make everyone see

35:35.270 --> 35:36.470
that he is thriving,

35:36.470 --> 35:37.229
that he is a useful plant

35:37.549 --> 35:38.750
and will not harm the crops,

35:39.229 --> 35:40.589
so he will not be uprooted.

35:44.350 --> 35:45.950
You are right.

35:47.350 --> 35:50.229
The more someone rises from the bottom,

35:50.830 --> 35:52.669
the more they fear two things.

35:53.629 --> 35:55.870
First, becoming insatiably hungry
for advancement.

35:56.470 --> 35:57.390
Second,

35:57.509 --> 35:59.990
blindly proving loyalty to those
above them.

36:02.029 --> 36:03.629
Don't be fooled by the fact
that the Zhao family

36:03.629 --> 36:05.830
is currently at the height of its glory,

36:05.910 --> 36:07.669
enjoying unprecedented success.

36:08.470 --> 36:11.350
In truth, Zhao Ling is surrounded
by enemies on all sides,

36:11.709 --> 36:13.629
and has lost the support
of the Northwest.

36:14.189 --> 36:16.709
The moment the Emperor
stops protecting him,

36:17.229 --> 36:19.069
he will be doomed beyond redemption.

36:21.430 --> 36:23.189
Young men...

36:25.029 --> 36:27.669
never know that the higher they climb,
the harder they fall.

36:27.712 --> 36:28.928
(Xie Residence)

36:29.109 --> 36:30.709
Congratulations, General Zhao.

36:30.709 --> 36:31.750
Congratulations!

36:31.750 --> 36:32.350
Congratulations!

36:32.350 --> 36:32.830
When you have time,

36:32.830 --> 36:34.430
you must visit the Zhou Residence
sometime.

36:34.509 --> 36:35.350
Of course.

36:38.549 --> 36:39.109
Please.

36:39.589 --> 36:39.950
Thank you.

36:43.990 --> 36:45.390
Do you remember back in Ganlin,

36:45.950 --> 36:47.509
General Mo couldn't openly favor us,

36:48.229 --> 36:49.629
but whenever assignments were given,

36:50.069 --> 36:51.549
he would quietly arrange for us

36:51.830 --> 36:53.229
to work alongside Mr. Zhao.

36:54.350 --> 36:55.629
But today,

36:56.069 --> 36:56.990
he has to smile

36:57.910 --> 36:59.629
and make everyone see how happy he is.

37:00.350 --> 37:02.029
Madam Wei is tied up with family matters

37:02.430 --> 37:03.549
and sends her apologies
for not attending.

37:03.669 --> 37:04.470
She sent someone

37:04.470 --> 37:05.830
with a generous gift instead.

37:06.830 --> 37:09.470
Why don't we see the ladies
from the Northwest?

37:09.470 --> 37:11.109
Perhaps they were invited,

37:11.509 --> 37:12.709
but didn't dare show up.

37:13.029 --> 37:13.910
Madam Zhao,

37:14.029 --> 37:15.350
take my advice.

37:15.669 --> 37:18.069
A husband is a woman's lifelong support.

37:18.069 --> 37:19.549
On such a joyous occasion,

37:19.549 --> 37:21.310
don't let outsiders ruin your mood.

37:21.470 --> 37:22.430
Exactly.

37:22.669 --> 37:24.189
A married woman should
follow her husband.

37:24.430 --> 37:25.629
Now that you are the lady
of the household,

37:25.709 --> 37:27.270
your every word and action

37:27.270 --> 37:28.750
represent the Zhao family.

37:28.750 --> 37:30.390
As long as husband and wife
stand together,

37:30.470 --> 37:31.830
you can look forward to

37:31.830 --> 37:33.229
a life of wealth and glory.

37:33.229 --> 37:34.310
Exactly.

37:34.549 --> 37:35.029
Here.

37:35.270 --> 37:36.270
Madam Zhao,

37:36.470 --> 37:37.430
have another drink.

37:37.750 --> 37:38.270
Cheers.

37:38.470 --> 37:38.910
Cheers.

37:38.990 --> 37:39.750
General Zhao,

37:39.950 --> 37:41.870
if you ever need our help,

37:41.870 --> 37:42.990
just say the word.

37:45.430 --> 37:46.310
General Zhao,

37:46.310 --> 37:47.629
you are the one most favored
by His Majesty.

37:47.629 --> 37:48.990
But we wonder,

37:48.990 --> 37:51.189
what does His Majesty truly think
of the new salt reform?

37:51.350 --> 37:52.589
General Zhao,

37:52.589 --> 37:53.910
could you give us some insight?

37:54.310 --> 37:55.229
Yes.

37:55.229 --> 37:56.470
What is His Majesty's stance

37:56.470 --> 37:57.910
on the salt reform?

37:57.910 --> 37:59.669
We hope you can enlighten us,
General Zhao.

37:59.910 --> 38:01.270
Please enlighten us.

38:07.750 --> 38:08.549
General Zhao is drunk.

38:08.549 --> 38:09.790
Help him get some rest.

38:10.870 --> 38:11.229
General.

38:11.229 --> 38:12.069
Mr. Zhao.

38:12.189 --> 38:12.750
Come on. Easy.

38:13.109 --> 38:13.629
Careful.

38:15.870 --> 38:16.629
Farewell, General Zhao.

38:16.629 --> 38:17.790
Take care, General Zhao.

38:17.790 --> 38:18.549
Farewell, General Zhao.

38:24.980 --> 38:27.168
(Next Episode)

38:27.350 --> 38:28.830
I'm afraid that one day,

38:29.509 --> 38:31.189
I may have to abandon everyone,

38:31.430 --> 38:32.470
including you.

38:33.709 --> 38:34.669
Then perhaps

38:35.229 --> 38:36.509
we should end our marriage.

38:36.990 --> 38:39.270
I will never leave you alone
in the capital.

38:39.390 --> 38:40.549
You can't beat them.

38:40.870 --> 38:41.669
Nonsense!

38:41.990 --> 38:43.350
What nonsense are you talking about?

38:43.629 --> 38:44.990
The more chaotic this household becomes,

38:45.189 --> 38:46.470
the happier I am.

38:46.790 --> 38:49.350
I have a thousand ways to kill her.

38:49.549 --> 38:50.950
One used me.

38:51.470 --> 38:52.750
The other threatened me.

38:53.270 --> 38:54.470
Young Lord Yu,

38:54.910 --> 38:56.390
watch yourself.

39:09.800 --> 39:14.120
♪The past brushes by
like a falling leaf♪

39:17.720 --> 39:22.080
♪So light, yet my steps still pause
for you♪

39:24.200 --> 39:28.840
♪Through every rise and fall,
our memories remain without regret♪

39:29.080 --> 39:31.880
♪Carved into the rings of time♪

39:33.040 --> 39:37.680
♪How I wish I could stay
a little longer, but I can't♪

39:40.880 --> 39:47.720
♪I turn away, afraid goodbye will fill
my eyes with tears♪

39:48.600 --> 39:55.120
♪Etched deep within my heart,
yet buried without a word♪

39:56.080 --> 39:59.520
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

40:00.040 --> 40:04.240
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

40:04.520 --> 40:10.200
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪

40:22.320 --> 40:26.200
♪For one fleeting moment, I found you
in the crowd♪

40:30.120 --> 40:34.120
♪Without a word, you lit up
half my life♪

40:35.840 --> 40:40.520
♪In silence, a love too deep for words♪

40:40.840 --> 40:43.520
♪Kept close within my heart♪

40:44.600 --> 40:49.440
♪From now on, no one else
is worth waiting for♪

40:52.960 --> 40:59.880
♪I turn away, afraid no one
will ever come home to me again♪

41:00.760 --> 41:07.240
♪If we can build our future together,
no storm can chill my heart♪

41:08.120 --> 41:11.640
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

41:12.080 --> 41:16.440
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

41:16.640 --> 41:22.360
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪
